1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,000
Jupiter passes one finger from the Moon on November thirtieth.

2
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:07,540
If Earth were a grape, Jupiter is a whole basketball.

3
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:10,280
It is forty times wider than our Moon.

4
00:00:10,660 --> 00:00:16,440
Yet Jupiter sits two thousand times farther, over seven hundred million kilometres away.

5
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:18,440
Look south in the morning sky.
